Subject: [PATCH] extensions: take the I2C bus from MECHANIX_EXTENSIONS_I2C_BUS

The detector polls a hardcoded /dev/i2c-2. Let the environment name the bus the
extension connector is on (default unchanged); mechumu points it at its virtual
connector. Meant for upstream mechanix-gui.
---
diff --git a/dbus/mechanix/extensions/src/detection/i2c.rs b/dbus/mechanix/extensions/src/detection/i2c.rs
index 1172065..89d2ede 100644
--- a/dbus/mechanix/extensions/src/detection/i2c.rs
+++ b/dbus/mechanix/extensions/src/detection/i2c.rs
